msgid "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>change<else>changes</if> the PvP team crest design."
