#. macro: <if ($gn68 == 14)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 5)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 26)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 68 (the player's current class or job, a ClassJob row) == 14 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn68 == 5)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 26)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 33)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else>a <sheet… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 68 (the player's current class or job, a ClassJob row) == 5 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn68 == 26)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 33)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else>a <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 68 (the player's current class or job, a ClassJob row) == 26 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn68 == 33)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else>a <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 68 (the player's current class or job, a ClassJob row) == 33 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "LogMessage:7984:0:5"
msgid "You are currently equipped with the recommended gear for <if ($gn68 == 10)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 14)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 5)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 26)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 33)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else>a <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if></if></if></if>."
msgstr "На вас уже надет лучший комплект для класса или профессии «<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0>»."

#. ja: <if ($n1 == 0)>一部のアイテムを装備できませんでした。<else>装備変更できませんでした。</if>
#. de: <if ($n1 == 0)>Ein Teil der Gegenstände konnte nicht angelegt werden.<else>Die Ausrüstung konnte nicht geändert werden.</if>
#. fr: <if ($n1 == 0)>Une partie de l'équipement n'a pas pu être appliqué.<else>L'équipement n'a pas pu être changé.</if>
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 0)>Unable to equip one or more pieces of gear.<else>Unable to change gear.</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "LogMessage:7985:0:5"
msgid "<if ($n1 == 0)>Unable to equip one or more pieces of gear.<else>Unable to change gear.</if>"
msgstr "<if ($n1 == 0)>Не удалось надеть некоторые предметы.<else>Не удалось сменить снаряжение.</if>"

#. ja: 「クロの空想帳」対象コンテンツのコンプリート条件を満たしました。
#. de: Du erfüllst die Bedingungen für einen Inhalt in Khloes Aben<shy>teuer<shy>album.
#. fr: Vous avez réussi une aventure du carnet de Khloe.
msgctxt "LogMessage:7986:0:5"
msgid "Wondrous Tails duty complete."
msgstr "Задание для «Чудесных сказаний» завершено."

#. ja: 「不屈の闘志」により、己の限界を突破した！
#. de: Du aktivierst die inneren Kräfte des wahren Selbst und wächst über dich hinaus.
#. fr: Votre volonté inflexible vous permet de dépasser vos limites<nbsp>!
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>Your<else><if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if>'s</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 7 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet ObjStr $gn7 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = ObjStr, row = global number 7, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><if "<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>">her<else>him</if><else><if $gn5>her<else>him</if></if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn7><if "<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>">her<else>him</if><else><if $gn5>her<else>him</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 7 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if "<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>">her<else>him</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = text with macros (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet BNpcName $gn7 6> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = BNpcName, row = global number 7, column = 6 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if $gn5>her<else>him</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 5 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>your<else><if $gn7><if "<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>">her<else>his</if><else><if $gn5>her<else>his</if></if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn7><if "<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>">her<else>his</if><else><if $gn5>her<else>his</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 7 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if "<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>">her<else>his</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = text with macros (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn5>her<else>his</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 5 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "LogMessage:7987:0:5"
msgid "<if ($gs1 == $gs2)>Your<else><if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if>'s</if> true self emerges, granting <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><if \"<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>\">her<else>him</if><else><if $gn5>her<else>him</if></if></if> strength beyond <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>your<else><if $gn7><if \"<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>\">her<else>his</if><else><if $gn5>her<else>his</if></if></if> limits!"
msgstr "<if ($gs1 == $gs2)>Твоё истинное «я» пробуждается<else>Истинное «я» <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if> пробуждается</if>, даруя <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>тебе<else><if $gn7><if \"<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>\">ей<else>ему</if><else><if $gn5>ей<else>ему</if></if></if> силу, чтобы превзойти собственные пределы!"

#. ja: リミテッドジョブまたは非バトルクラスのため、ご褒美を受け取れません。
#. de: Beschränkte Jobs und Handwerker bzw. Sammler können keine Belohnungen annehmen.
#. fr: Impossible d'obtenir la récompense. Vous n'êtes ni combattant ni mage ou vous êtes dans un job restreint.
msgctxt "LogMessage:7988:0:5"
msgid "Unable to accept reward. You are not a Disciple of War or Magic (excluding limited jobs)."
msgstr "Нельзя получить награду: вы не воин и не маг либо используете ограниченную профессию."

#. ja: これ以上ギルを受け取れません。譲渡できませんでした。
#. de: Spende nicht möglich. Du kannst nicht mehr Gil entgegennehmen.
#. fr: Don impossible.<br>Vous ne pouvez pas posséder davantage de gils.
msgctxt "LogMessage:7990:0:5"
msgid "Unable to make donation. You cannot receive any more gil."
msgstr "Не удалось передать гилы: у вас уже нет места для дополнительных гил."

#. ja: 1度に10件までしか譲渡できません。
#. de: Es können maximal 10 Gegenstände auf einmal gespendet werden.
#. fr: Vous ne pouvez donner que 10 types d'objet à la fois.
msgctxt "LogMessage:7991:0:5"
msgid "Unable to donate more than 10 items at once."
msgstr "Нельзя передать больше 10 предметов за раз."

#. ja: <sheet Item $n1 0>×<num $n2>を譲渡しました。
#. de: Du spendest <num $n2> <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-de Item 5 $n1 1 4 1><else><noun-de Item 5 $n1 2 4 1></if>.
#. fr: Vous avez donné <num $n2><nbsp><if ($n2 == 1)><noun-fr Item 12 $n1 1 1><else><noun-fr Item 12 $n1 2 1></if>.
#. macro: <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1><else><num $n2> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 $n2 1></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 $n2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = number parameter 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:7992:0:5"
msgid "You donate <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1><else><num $n2> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 $n2 1></if>."
msgstr "Вы передаёте <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1><else><num $n2> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 $n2 1></if>."

#. ja: <sheet Item $n1 0>×<num $n2>を<kilo $n3 ",">ギルで譲渡しました。
#. de: Du spendest <num $n2> <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-de Item 5 $n1 1 4 1><else><noun-de Item 5 $n1 2 4 1></if> und erhältst zum Dank <kilo $n3 "."> Gil.
#. fr: Vous avez donné <num $n2><nbsp><if ($n2 == 1)><noun-fr Item 12 $n1 1 1><else><noun-fr Item 12 $n1 2 1></if>, et reçu <kilo $n3 "<nbsp>"> <if ($n3 == 1)>gil<else>gils</if> en guise de re<shy>mer<shy>cie<shy>ments.
#. macro: <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1><else><num $n2> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 $n2 1></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 $n2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = number parameter 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <kilo $n3 ","> — a number with a thousands separator; value = number parameter 3, separator = , (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:7993:0:5"
msgid "You donate <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1><else><num $n2> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 $n2 1></if> and receive <kilo $n3 \",\"> gil."
msgstr "Вы передаёте <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1><else><num $n2> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 $n2 1></if> и получаете <kilo $n3 \",\"> гил."

#. ja: コンテンツ中のため表示できません。
#. de: Die gewünschte Aktion ist in Inhalten nicht möglich.
#. fr: Affichage impossible durant une mission.
msgctxt "LogMessage:7994:0:5"
msgid "Unable to display while bound by duty."
msgstr "Нельзя открыть во время прохождения задания."

#. ja: コンテンツファインダーの対象コンテンツでないため開けません。
#. de: Dieser Inhalt kann nicht über die Inhaltssuche betreten werden.
#. fr: Accès impossible par l'outil de mission.
msgctxt "LogMessage:7995:0:5"
msgid "This duty or category cannot be accessed via the Duty Finder."
msgstr "Это задание или категория недоступны через поиск подземелий."

#. ja: 対象コンテンツが未開放のため開けません。
#. de: Dieser Inhalt wurde noch nicht freigespielt.
#. fr: Accès impossible. Cette mission n'a pas été débloquée.
msgctxt "LogMessage:7996:0:5"
msgid "This duty or category has not been unlocked."
msgstr "Это задание или категория ещё не открыты."

#. ja: メインクエストが特定の進行状態に至っていないため、空想帳(蒼天編)が付与されました。
#. de: Du hast ein Aben<shy>teuer<shy>album erhalten, das deinem momentanen Fortschritt im Hauptszenario entspricht.
#. fr: Conformément à votre progression actuelle dans l'épopée, vous avez reçu un carnet de Khloe (Heavensward).
msgctxt "LogMessage:7997:0:5"
msgid "You have received a journal corresponding to your current progress in the main scenario."
msgstr "Вы получили дневник, соответствующий вашему текущему прогрессу в основном сюжете."
